---
/**
 * Team / handler view — request with activity and properties.
 */
---

<figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-surface shadow-[var(--shadow-quiet)]">
  <div class="border-b border-zinc-200/80 px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
    <p class="text-[0.75rem] text-zinc-400">Inbox · IT Help Desk · REQ-3</p>
    <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.25rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[1.375rem]">
          Set up a shared mailbox
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-zinc-500">
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-status-open" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Open · started by Nic
        </p>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        tabindex="-1"
        class="text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-ink"
      >
        Mark as resolved
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_14rem]">
    <div class="space-y-3 border-b border-zinc-200/80 bg-canvas p-4 sm:p-5 lg:border-r lg:border-b-0">
      <p class="text-[0.75rem] font-semibold text-ink">Activity</p>

      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-surface px-3.5 py-3">
        <p class="text-[0.75rem] font-medium text-ink">Nic</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
          Need to create a new mailbox called qa@openrequest.co and make me and Tommy and Alfie as
          members.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-surface px-3.5 py-3">
        <p class="text-[0.75rem] font-medium text-ink">Rolo Rex</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
          Hi Nic — thanks for raising this. We are currently creating the mailbox and will delegate
          to the members as requested.
        </p>
      </article>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-surface px-3.5 py-3">
        <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-zinc-400">Leave a comment…</p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex justify-end">
          <span class="rounded-md bg-accent px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.75rem] font-medium text-white">
            Comment
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="bg-surface px-4 py-4 sm:px-5">
      <p class="type-caption mb-3">Properties</p>
      <dl class="space-y-3 text-[0.8125rem]">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-zinc-400">Status</dt>
          <dd class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-ink">
            <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-status-open" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Open
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-zinc-400">Raised by</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium text-ink">Nic</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-zinc-400">Assignee</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium text-accent">Rolo Rex</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-zinc-400">Team</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium text-ink">IT Help Desk</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <dt class="text-zinc-400">Type</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium text-ink">Mailbox</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>
</figure>
